<main>
    <section id="collab" class="panel-section" data-shape="cubes" data-label="Collaboration">
        <div class="wrap"><div class="col">
            <div class="eyebrow">Collaboration</div>
            <h1>Let's build it <em>together.</em></h1>
            <p class="lead">I collaborate with startups, businesses and individuals to build practical automation that solves real-world problems.</p>
            <p>If you have an idea, or an existing product you want to improve, let's discuss it and turn it into a reliable, market-ready solution.</p>
            <div class="cta"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Discuss your project</a></div>
        </div></div>
    </section>

    <section id="services" class="panel-section r" data-shape="chip" data-label="What I help with">
        <div class="wrap"><div class="col">
            <div class="eyebrow">What I can help with</div>
            <h2>End-to-end, hardware to software.</h2>
            <div class="glass rows">
                <div><h3>Embedded systems &amp; firmware</h3><p>Microcontroller firmware, drivers and low-level control.</p></div>
                <div><h3>Automation &amp; IoT product design</h3><p>Connected devices designed for real use, not just demos.</p></div>
                <div><h3>Rapid prototyping</h3><p>Proof-of-concept builds to test an idea quickly.</p></div>
                <div><h3>Integration, optimisation &amp; support</h3><p>Fitting systems together, making them faster, and keeping them running.</p></div>
            </div>
        </div></div>
    </section>

