        <div class="wrap"><div class="col">
            <div class="eyebrow">How a project runs</div>
            <h2>From concept to deployment.</h2>
            <ol class="steps">
                <li><h3>Concept</h3><p>We pin down the problem, the constraints and what "working" means.</p></li>
                <li><h3>Prototype</h3><p>Custom hardware, firmware and software integrated into a first build.</p></li>
                <li><h3>Testing</h3><p>Real-world trials to make it reliable before it ships.</p></li>
                <li><h3>Deployment</h3><p>Rollout and long-term support.</p></li>
            </ol>
        </div></div>
    </section>

